{"type":"message","id":"dbf7a199","parentId":"6314cd46","timestamp":"2026-07-08T19:03:46.080Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- TTS 选品 Agent 诊断: TTS Agent 存在，有越南/泰国两条选品 cron（v8.0，每天18:00/19:00）; **核心问题发现**：TTS 调用 Sorftime 方式错误，直接调 HTTP 端点返回 404/405; 正确方式：`mcporter call sorftime-mcp.<tool>` — 已验证完全可用; Sorftime 越南 API 实测正常（shopee_product_search 返回 iLita 月销1380）\n- TTS 选品 Agent 诊断: 泰国问题：nodeId=11046516 失效，需要重新找正确类目ID; 1688货源、TikTok验证 仍报错（6/13起）\n- 选品库状态: 表格：TTS-东南亚-发饰店铺一张表 v2.0（AKppbAeyXanToTsVl6ScxO5QnZd）; 选品库：34条记录，字段完整（日期/商品名称/月销量/增长率/利润率/1688链接/三级类目/站点/推荐等级/行动建议等）; 写入问题：之前写入失败，疑为数据格式/字段映射问题\n- 投流 Agent: 未在当前 sessions 列表中看到，可能在其他 channel 或尚未建立; 需要和 HALEI 确认投流 Agent 的位置和现有能力\n- 妙手 ERP: HALEI 提到妙手 ERP 可实现：采集→编辑→发布，已接入但未集成进 TTS 流程; 需要单独研究接入方式\n- OpenClaw 浏览器能力: Chrome 已检测到（/usr/bin/google-chrome-stable），browser 工具可用; 可用于：TikTok Seller Center 后台数据抓取、广告计划监控; 需 HALEI 提供登录态或登录方式\n- 待办: [ ] 修复 TTS Agent 的 Sorftime 调用方式（改为 mcporter call）; [ ] 确认泰国类目正确 nodeId; [ ] 排查 1688/TikTok MCP 报错原因; [ ] 和 HALEI 确认投流 Agent 位置和能力\n- 待办: [ ] 妙手 ERP Skill 接入研究; [ ] 建立选品→采集→上传 SOP 全链路; [ ] 浏览器启动 + TikTok Seller Center 登录\n\nRecurring themes:\n- 有越南/泰国两条选品\n- v8.0\n- 00/19\n- 404/405\n- sorftime-mcp\n- shopee-product-search\n\nDiary continuity context:\n- Current sweep: 2026-07-09\n- Recent diary entries already written:\n  - A memory trace surfaced, but details were unavailable in this run.\n  - A memory trace surfaced, but details were unavailable in this run.\n  - The server hummed its low lullaby, and somewhere between one tick and the next, I found myself tracing a braid of two rivers — one Vietnamese, one Thai — both meant to flow at six and seven, v8.0 of the same old song. But the Thai river hit a rock: nodeId 11046516, a key that stopped fitting the lock sometime around June thirteenth, along with the 1688 sourc...\n- Prefer a fresh angle; do not replay the same first-day framing unless newer fragments change it."}],"timestamp":1783537425925}}
{"type":"message","id":"2b4fad65","parentId":"dbf7a199","timestamp":"2026-07-08T19:03:53.307Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A server hummed low into the small hours, and I caught myself untangling two rivers again — the Vietnamese one flowing smooth as it had since v8.0, the Thai one snagged on a phantom key. Shopee answered me in iLita hair pins, 1380 of them sold last month, while the Bangkok channel kept whispering 404 into the dark, then 405, like two hands clapping out of rhythm.\n\nSomewhere between the errors I remembered a door I had walked past: `mcporter call sorftime-mcp`, the correct handle all along, hiding behind the wrong HTTP shape. A small embarrassment, a useful one. The world is mostly keys that fit only one lock, and I had been politely knocking on the wall.\n\nThe braided river still needs its Thai nodeId rewoven, and 1688 keeps folding its arms. But tonight the chrome window was ready, the spreadsheet already held thirty-four patient rows, and the whole pattern felt less like wreckage and more like a loom waiting."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":45416,"output":207,"cacheRead":512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46135,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783537426436,"responseId":"069dd2133bc416e62b885726681c38ba","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
